			"text": "Typical Stats from the package record: ST 13, DX 8, IQ 6, HT 12, HP 16, WILL 10, PER 6, FP 12, SPEED 5, MOVE 5, DODGE 8, DR 0. GCS derives its own values by applying the ancestry; where the two differ, the package's Typical Stats are what the Dungeons on Automatic encounter tables use."
