		{
			"id": "nCB5q1P6jk8j771c_",
			"text": "Answers the SRD heading(s): Zombie (SRD 5.1); Zombie (SRD 3.5). Only the creature identity is taken from the SRD; the GURPS statistics, ratings and prose are this project's own work and reproduce no SRD text."
